  "HR": "<p>We found no shop selling raw glaze materials in Croatia.</p><div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="Shops in Croatia"><table class="guide-table shop-table"><caption> Shops elsewhere that say they deliver to Croatia (checked October 8, 2026) </caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Shop</th><th scope="col">Sells</th><th scope="col">Packs seen</th><th scope="col">Materials seen, by the shop's names</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://manufaktura-radovljica.si/si/9-minerali">Manufaktura Radovljica</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Radovljica, Ljubljana, Slovenia</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, clay, and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Feldspat kalij 4012; Feldspat natrij 4013; Kaolin 4021; Kremen SiO2 4029M</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://bpkeramia.hu/termek_kategoria/nyersanyagok/">BP Kerámia</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Budapest, Hungary</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, stains, ready-made glazes, clay, and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg and 25 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Káliföldpát; Nátriumföldpát; China clay (BSZ 4006); Kvarcliszt</span><br> Orders by phone or email, from a price list. </td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://shop.keramik.at/de/c/ola1-2/Rohstoffe.html">Keramik Lehrer</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Leonding, Austria</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, clay, ready-made glazes, and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg, 5 kg, and 25 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Kali-Feldspat 13014; Natron-Feldspat 13015; Kaolin 13016; Quarzmehl W10 13020</span></td></tr></tbody></table></d