  "MT": "<p>We found no shop selling raw glaze materials in Malta.</p><div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="Shops in Malta"><table class="guide-table shop-table"><caption> Shops elsewhere that say they deliver to Malta (checked 08 October 2026) </caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Shop</th><th scope="col">Sells</th><th scope="col">Packs seen</th><th scope="col">Materials seen, by the shop's names</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://solargil.com/matieres-premieres">Solargil</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Moutiers-en-Puisaye, France</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, oxides and clay</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg, 5 kg and 25 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Feldspath potassique FEL-K; Kaolin pulvérisé; Carbonate de chaux; Silice 400</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://solargil.com/matieres-premieres">solargil.com</a>, <a href="https://solargil.com/content/livraison">solargil.com</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
