  "NZ": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="Shops in New Zealand"><table class="guide-table shop-table"><caption> Some shops selling raw glaze materials in New Zealand (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Shop</th><th scope="col">Sells</th><th scope="col">Packs seen</th><th scope="col">Materials seen, by the shop's names</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://www.ccg.co.nz/craft/products/category/4375/raw-materials">CCG</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Rosedale (Auckland)</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, clay and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">500 g, 1 kg, 2.5 kg, 5 kg and 25 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Feldspar Potash K200; NZ China Clay Ultrafine; Silica 325# Mesh; Calcium Carbonate</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://decopot.co.nz/collections/raw-materials">Decopot</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Palmerston North</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, oxides and clay</td><td data-label="Packs seen">2.5 kg, 5 kg and 25 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Potash Feldspar 200#; NZ China Clay Ultrafine; Silica 325#; Calcium Carbonate 200#</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.ccg.co.nz/craft/products/category/4375/raw-materials">ccg.co.nz</a>, <a href="https://decopot.co.nz/collections/raw-materials">decopot.co.nz</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "PL": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="Shops in Poland"><table class="guide-table shop-table"><caption> Some shops selling raw glaze materials in Poland (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Shop</th><th scope="col">Sells</th><th scope="col">Packs seen</th><th scope="col">Materials seen, by the shop's names</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://www.agani.pl/category/surowce">AGANI</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Świętochłowice</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, ready-made glazes and clay</td><td data-label="Packs seen">100 g and 1 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Skaleń potasowy (Orthoklas); Skaleń sodowy (Albit); Kwarc W10 (mączka kwarcowa)</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://heho.pl/pl/c/SUROWCE-CHEMICZNE/93">HEHO</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Poznań</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, ready-made glazes and clay</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Skaleń potasowy / Ortoklaz; Skaleń sodowy / Albit; Kaolin</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://swiatgliny.pl/pl/11-surowce">Świat Gliny</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Gliwice</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, stains, ready-made glazes, clay and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Skaleń potasowy 2/75; Kaolin; Mączka kwarcowa W 10</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.agani.pl/category/surowce">agani.pl</a>, <a href="https://heho.pl/pl/c/SUROWCE-CHEMICZNE/93">heho.pl</a>, <a href="https://swiatgliny.pl/pl/11-surowce">swiatgliny.pl</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "PT": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="Shops in Portugal"><table class="guide-table shop-table"><caption> Some shops selling raw glaze materials in Portugal (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Shop</th><th scope="col">Sells</th><th scope="col">Packs seen</th><th scope="col">Materials seen, by the shop's names</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://ceramistashop.pt/collections/materias-primas">Ceramistashop</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Lisboa, Oeiras, Porto, Setúbal</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, clay and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">100 g and 1 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Feldspato potássico 50101501; Feldspato sódico; Caulino; Sílica</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://graffitostore.com/en/product-category/raw-materials/">Graffito Store</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Alcobaça</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits and oxides</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg and 5 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Potassium feldspar 404000006; Kaolin VE; Silica SS100</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://ceramistashop.pt/collections/materias-primas">ceramistashop.pt</a>, <a href="https://graffitostore.com/en/product-category/raw-materials/">graffitostore.com</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "RO": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="Shops in Romania"><table class="guide-table shop-table"><caption> Some shops selling raw glaze materials in Romania (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Shop</th><th scope="col">Sells</th><th scope="col">Packs seen</th><th scope="col">Materials seen, by the shop's names</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://interceram.ro/shop/materii-prime-de-baza">Interceram</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Sighișoara</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, oxides, clay and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Feldspat potasic FK-80; Feldspat sodic; Caolin Zettlici; Făină de cuarț</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://www.barro.ro/collections/materii-prime">Barro</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">București</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, oxides, clay and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">100 g, 500 g and 1 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Feldspat potasic; Feldspat sodic; Caolin China Clay; Carbonat de calciu (cretă)</span><br> No quartz seen. </td></tr></tbody></table></div><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://interceram.ro/shop/materii-prime-de-baza">interceram.ro</a>, <a href="https://www.barro.ro/collections/materii-prime">barro.ro</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "SE": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="Shops in Sweden"><table class="guide-table shop-table"><caption> Some shops selling raw glaze materials in Sweden (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Shop</th><th scope="col">Sells</th><th scope="col">Packs seen</th><th scope="col">Materials seen, by the shop's names</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://lermakeriet.se/produkt-kategori/ravaror/">Lermakeriet</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Valbo (Gävle)</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, clay and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg and 5 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Kalifältspat FFF 4122; Kaolin 4064; Kvarts 4080</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://www.tarn.se/ramaterial.htm">Lars Tärn</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Tomelilla</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, clay and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg, 2 kg and 5 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Kalifältspat; Natronfältspat; Kvarts 150 mesh</span><br> Orders by email, from a price list. </td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://cerama.se/keramik/raavaror/raavaror">Cerama</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Hvidovre (Danmark)</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, oxides, clay and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">2 kg, 5 kg and 25 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">1434 Kalifeldspat; 1450 Kaolin 50; 1460 Kvarts 140</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://lermakeriet.se/produkt-kategori/ravaror/">lermakeriet.se</a>, <a href="https://www.tarn.se/ramaterial.htm">tarn.se</a>, <a href="https://cerama.se/keramik/raavaror/raavaror">cerama.se</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "SI": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="Shops in Slovenia"><table class="guide-table shop-table"><caption> Some shops selling raw glaze materials in Slovenia (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Shop</th><th scope="col">Sells</th><th scope="col">Packs seen</th><th scope="col">Materials seen, by the shop's names</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://manufaktura-radovljica.si/si/9-minerali">Manufaktura Radovljica</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Radovljica, Ljubljana</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, clay and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Feldspat kalij 4012; Feldspat natrij 4013; Kaolin 4021; Kremen SiO2 4029M</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://manufaktura-radovljica.si/si/9-minerali">manufaktura-radovljica.si</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "SK": "<p>We found no shop selling raw glaze materials in Slovakia.</p><div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="Shops in Slovakia"><table class="guide-table shop-table"><caption> Shops elsewhere that say they deliver to Slovakia (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Shop</th><th scope="col">Sells</th><th scope="col">Packs seen</th><th scope="col">Materials seen, by the shop's names</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://bpkeramia.hu/termek_kategoria/nyersanyagok/">BP Kerámia</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Budapest, Hungary</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, stains, ready-made glazes, clay and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg and 25 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Káliföldpát; Nátriumföldpát; China clay (BSZ 4006); Kvarcliszt</span><br> Orders by phone or email, from a price list. </td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://www.keramickecentrum.cz/kategorie/42/suroviny">Keramické centrum</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Praha, Brno, Pečky, Czechia</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, oxides, ready-made glazes, clay and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">100 g and 1 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Živec K 2/75 draselný (Orthoklas); Živec NA LF 90 sodný (Albit); Kaolin</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://shop.keramik.at/de/c/ola1-2/Rohstoffe.html">Keramik Lehrer</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Leonding, Austria</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, clay, ready-made glazes and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 kg, 5 kg and 25 kg</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Kali-Feldspat 13014; Natron-Feldspat 13015; Kaolin 13016; Quarzmehl W10 13020</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://bpkeramia.hu/termek_kategoria/nyersanyagok/">bpkeramia.hu</a>, <a href="https://bpkeramia.hu/2026/04/01/csomagkuldes-telefonos-vagy-email-ben-leadott-rendeles-alapjan/">bpkeramia.hu</a>, <a href="https://www.keramickecentrum.cz/kategorie/42/suroviny">keramickecentrum.cz</a>, <a href="https://www.keramickecentrum.cz/zpusob-doruceni-ceny-postovneho">keramickecentrum.cz</a>, <a href="https://shop.keramik.at/de/c/ola1-2/Rohstoffe.html">shop.keramik.at</a>, <a href="https://shop.keramik.at/de/cms/Versandkosten.html">shop.keramik.at</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "US": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="Shops in United States"><table class="guide-table shop-table"><caption> Some shops selling raw glaze materials in United States (checked October 8, 2026) </caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Shop</th><th scope="col">Sells</th><th scope="col">Packs seen</th><th scope="col">Materials seen, by the shop's names</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://www.lagunaclay.com/collections/dry-materials">Laguna Clay</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">City of Industry, California</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials and clay</td><td data-label="Packs seen">5 lb and 50 lb</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Minspar 200 (MFELMIN); Mahavir Potash Feldspar (MFELPF01); Silica 325 mesh (MSIL325); Whiting 325 mesh (MWHIT325)</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://clayartcenter.net/product-category/raw-materials/">Clay Art Center</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Tacoma, Washington</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials and clay</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 lb, 5 lb, 10 lb, 25 lb, and 50 lb</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Minspar 200; G200 EU Feldspar; 6 Tile Kaolin; Whiting</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://www.theceramicshop.com/store/category/7/7/chemicals/">The Ceramic Shop</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Norristown, Pennsylvania</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, clay, and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 lb and 50 lb</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Feldspar G200 EU (CH-G200EU); Minspar 200 (CH-KONA); Silica 200 mesh; Whiting (CH-WH)</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a translate="no" href="https://nmclay.com/potters-material-chemicals">New Mexico Clay</a><br><span translate="no" class="muted">Albuquerque, New Mexico</span></th><td data-label="Sells">raw glaze materials, frits, oxides, clay, and kilns</td><td data-label="Packs seen">1 lb</td><td data-label="Materials seen, by the shop's names"><span translate="no">Minspar 200; Feldspar Potash G200; Kaolin EPK; Silica 325 mesh (Sil-Co-Sil 49)</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.lagunaclay.com/collections/dry-materials">lagunaclay.com</a>, <a href="https://clayartcenter.net/product-category/raw-materials/">clayartcenter.net</a>, <a href="https://www.theceramicshop.com/store/category/7/7/chemicals/">theceramicshop.com</a>, <a href="https://nmclay.com/potters-material-chemicals">nmclay.com</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
}
`;

exports[`region blocks before Turkey > says exactly what it said before for every earlier region: silica 1`] = `
{
  "AT": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Austria"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Austria, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.ris.bka.gv.at/Dokumente/Bundesnormen/NOR40274774/II_339_2025_Anhang_I_2025.pdf">Grenzwerteverordnung (GKV), Anhang I</a>.</gc-rich> Lower than the EU's binding limit of 0,1 mg/m³. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.arbeitsinspektion.gv.at/">Arbeitsinspektion</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://www.arbeitsinspektion.gv.at/arbeitsschutz/arbeitsstoffe/arbeitsstoffe_mit_sonderbestimmungen/quarzfeinstaub.html">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.ris.bka.gv.at/Dokumente/Bundesnormen/NOR40274774/II_339_2025_Anhang_I_2025.pdf">ris.bka.gv.at</a>, <a href="https://www.arbeitsinspektion.gv.at/">arbeitsinspektion.gv.at</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "AU": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Australia"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Australia, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0.05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.worksafe.wa.gov.au/whs-duties-businesses-who-work-crystalline-silica-substances">Work Health and Safety Regulations: workplace exposure standards</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.worksafe.wa.gov.au/whs-duties-businesses-who-work-crystalline-silica-substances">worksafe.wa.gov.au</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "BE": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Belgium"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Belgium, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://werk.belgie.be/sites/default/files/content/documents/Welzijn%20op%20het%20werk/grenswaardentabel.pdf">Codex over het welzijn op het werk / Code du bien-être au travail, bijlage / annexe VI.1-1</a>.</gc-rich> Lower than the EU's binding limit of 0,1 mg/m³. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://werk.belgie.be/nl">FOD Werkgelegenheid, Arbeid en Sociaal Overleg / SPF Emploi, Travail et Concertation sociale (FOD WASO / SPF ETCS)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://werk.belgie.be/sites/default/files/content/documents/Welzijn%20op%20het%20werk/grenswaardentabel.pdf">werk.belgie.be</a>, <a href="https://werk.belgie.be/nl">werk.belgie.be</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "BG": "<p>We could not confirm the national limit in Bulgaria. The EU's binding limit of 0.1 mg/m³ applies in every member state.</p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.gli.government.bg/bg">Изпълнителна агенция „Главна инспекция по труда“ (ИА ГИТ)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.gli.government.bg/bg">gli.government.bg</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "CY": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Cyprus"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Cyprus, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0.1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.mlsi.gov.cy/mlsi/dli/dliup.nsf/all/D74ACEE6A814B7EAC2257E03002A76C9/$file/KDP_343_2025.pdf?openelement">Κ.Δ.Π. 343/2025 (Καρκινογόνοι Παράγοντες), Δεύτερος Πίνακας</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.mlsi.gov.cy/mlsi/dli/dliup.nsf/index_gr/index_gr?opendocument">Τμήμα Επιθεώρησης Εργασίας</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.mlsi.gov.cy/mlsi/dli/dliup.nsf/all/D74ACEE6A814B7EAC2257E03002A76C9/$file/KDP_343_2025.pdf?openelement">mlsi.gov.cy</a>, <a href="https://www.mlsi.gov.cy/mlsi/dli/dliup.nsf/index_gr/index_gr?opendocument">mlsi.gov.cy</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "CZ": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Czechia"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Czechia, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://e-sbirka.gov.cz/sb/2007/361">Nařízení vlády č. 361/2007 Sb., příloha č. 3</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://suip.gov.cz/">Státní úřad inspekce práce (SÚIP)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://e-sbirka.gov.cz/sb/2007/361">e-sbirka.gov.cz</a>, <a href="https://suip.gov.cz/">suip.gov.cz</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "DE": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Germany"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Germany, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> An assessment criterion, not a binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.baua.de/DE/Angebote/Regelwerk/TRGS/TRGS-559">TRGS 559 „Quarzhaltiger Staub“</a>.</gc-rich> Lower than the EU's binding limit of 0,1 mg/m³. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.baua.de/DE/Home/Home_node.html">Bundesanstalt für Arbeitsschutz und Arbeitsmedizin (BAuA)</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://www.baua.de/DE/Angebote/Regelwerk/TRGS/TRGS-559">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.baua.de/DE/Angebote/Regelwerk/TRGS/TRGS-559">baua.de</a>, <a href="https://www.baua.de/DE/Home/Home_node.html">baua.de</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "DK": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Denmark"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Denmark, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/613/pdf">Bekendtgørelse nr. 613 af 29. juni 2026 om grænseværdier for stoffer og materialer, bilag 2</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://at.dk/">Arbejdstilsynet</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://at.dk/faa-viden/arbejde-med-kemi-og-biologi/undgaa-stoev-paa-arbejdet/">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2026/613/pdf">retsinformation.dk</a>, <a href="https://at.dk/">at.dk</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "EE": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Estonia"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Estonia, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.riigiteataja.ee/aktilisa/1130/5202/6003/VV_08052026_m49lisa.pdf">Vabariigi Valitsuse määrus nr 49 (2026), lisa</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.ti.ee/">Tööinspektsioon</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.riigiteataja.ee/aktilisa/1130/5202/6003/VV_08052026_m49lisa.pdf">riigiteataja.ee</a>, <a href="https://www.ti.ee/">ti.ee</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "ES": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Spain"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Spain, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.boe.es/buscar/act.php?id=BOE-A-1997-11145">Real Decreto 665/1997, anexo III</a>.</gc-rich> Lower than the EU's binding limit of 0,1 mg/m³. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.insst.es/">Instituto Nacional de Seguridad y Salud en el Trabajo (INSST)</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://www.insst.es/agentes-quimicos-infocarquim/procedimientos/trabajos-que-supongan-exposicion-al-polvo-respirable-de-s%C3%ADlice-cristalina-generado-en-un-proceso-de-trabajo">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.boe.es/buscar/act.php?id=BOE-A-1997-11145">boe.es</a>, <a href="https://www.insst.es/">insst.es</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "FI": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Finland"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Finland, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.finlex.fi/fi/lainsaadanto/saadoskokoelma/2024/113">Valtioneuvoston asetus 113/2024, liite II</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit.  Finland's HTP value, which employers must take into account, is lower: 0.05 mg/m³. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.ttl.fi/">Työterveyslaitos</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://www.ttl.fi/teemat/tyoturvallisuus/altistuminen-tyoympariston-haittatekijoille/kemiallisten-tekijoiden-hallinta-tyopaikalla/tyoympariston-polyt/ohjeet-kvartsipolyn-hallintaan">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.finlex.fi/fi/lainsaadanto/saadoskokoelma/2024/113">finlex.fi</a>, <a href="https://www.ttl.fi/">ttl.fi</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "FR": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in France"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in France, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/codes/article_lc/LEGIARTI000053786000">Code du travail, article R. 4412-149</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.inrs.fr/">Institut national de recherche et de sécurité pour la prévention des accidents du travail et des maladies professionnelles (INRS)</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://www.inrs.fr/risques/silice-cristalline/ce-qu-il-faut-retenir.html">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/codes/article_lc/LEGIARTI000053786000">legifrance.gouv.fr</a>, <a href="https://www.inrs.fr/">inrs.fr</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "GB": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in United Kingdom"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in United Kingdom, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0.1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.hse.gov.uk/pubns/priced/eh40.pdf">EH40/2005 Workplace exposure limits</a>.</gc-rich></p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.hse.gov.uk/">Health and Safety Executive (HSE)</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://www.hse.gov.uk/lung-disease/silicosis.htm">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.hse.gov.uk/pubns/priced/eh40.pdf">hse.gov.uk</a>, <a href="https://www.hse.gov.uk/">hse.gov.uk</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "GR": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Greece"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Greece, an 8-hour average (checked October 8, 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0.1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.et.gr/api/DownloadFeksApi/?fek_pdf=20240100136">Π.Δ. 48/2024, Παράρτημα III</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.elinyae.gr/">Ελληνικό Ινστιτούτο Υγείας και Ασφάλειας στην Εργασία (ΕΛ.ΙΝ.Υ.Α.Ε.)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.et.gr/api/DownloadFeksApi/?fek_pdf=20240100136">et.gr</a>, <a href="https://www.elinyae.gr/">elinyae.gr</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "HR": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Croatia"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Croatia, an 8-hour average (checked October 8, 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz</th><td class="num">0.1 mg/m³</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cristobalite</th><td class="num">0.05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://narodne-novine.nn.hr/clanci/sluzbeni/2023_12_148_2098.html">Pravilnik o zaštiti radnika od izloženosti opasnim kemikalijama na radu, Prilog I</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://mrosp.gov.hr/">Ministarstvo rada, mirovinskoga sustava, obitelji i socijalne politike (MROSP)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://narodne-novine.nn.hr/clanci/sluzbeni/2023_12_148_2098.html">narodne-novine.nn.hr</a>, <a href="https://mrosp.gov.hr/">mrosp.gov.hr</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "HU": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Hungary"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Hungary, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://njt.jog.gov.hu/jogszabaly/2020-5-20-7Q">5/2020. (II. 6.) ITM rendelet, 2. melléklet</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://mvff.munka.hu/">Szociális és Családügyi Minisztérium – Munkavédelmi Irányítási Főosztály</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://njt.jog.gov.hu/jogszabaly/2020-5-20-7Q">njt.jog.gov.hu</a>, <a href="https://mvff.munka.hu/">mvff.munka.hu</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "IE": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Ireland"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Ireland, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0.1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.hsa.ie/media/5yglnef1/2026-code-of-practice-for-the-safety-health-and-welfare-at-work-chemical-agents-regulations-2001-to-2026-and-the-safety-health-and-welfare-at-work-carcinogens-mutagens-and-reprotoxic-substanc.pdf">HSA, 2026 Code of Practice for the Chemical Agents and Carcinogens Regulations, Schedule 1</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.hsa.ie/">Health and Safety Authority (HSA)</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://hsa.ie/your_industry/construction/silica-dust/">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.hsa.ie/media/5yglnef1/2026-code-of-practice-for-the-safety-health-and-welfare-at-work-chemical-agents-regulations-2001-to-2026-and-the-safety-health-and-welfare-at-work-carcinogens-mutagens-and-reprotoxic-substanc.pdf">hsa.ie</a>, <a href="https://www.hsa.ie/">hsa.ie</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "IT": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Italy"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Italy, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.normattiva.it/uri-res/N2Ls?urn:nir:stato:decreto.legislativo:2008-04-09;81">D.Lgs. 81/2008, allegato XLIII</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.inail.it/portale/it.html">Istituto Nazionale per l'Assicurazione contro gli Infortuni sul Lavoro (INAIL)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.normattiva.it/uri-res/N2Ls?urn:nir:stato:decreto.legislativo:2008-04-09;81">normattiva.it</a>, <a href="https://www.inail.it/portale/it.html">inail.it</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "JP": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Japan"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The yardstick for respirable crystalline silica in the air of a work area in Japan (checked October 13, 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Control concentration, where Q is the free silica in the dust, in %</th><td class="num"> 3.0 / (1.19Q + 1) mg/m³ </td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Control concentration for dust that is all free silica</th><td class="num">0.025 mg/m³</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Recommended by JSOH</th><td class="num">0.03 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A control concentration (管理濃度): the yardstick for judging the air of a work area from measurements there, not a limit on what one person breathes. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.jaish.gr.jp/horei/hor1-18/hor1-18-2-1-2.html">作業環境評価基準（昭和63年労働省告示第79号）別表</a>.</gc-rich></p><p><gc-rich>JSOH (Japan Society for Occupational Health) recommends this value in its <a href="https://www.sanei.or.jp/english/files/topics/oels/oel_en_2025.pdf">Recommendation of Occupational Exposure Limits (2025–2026)</a>. It is not law.</gc-rich></p><p><gc-rich>Dust masks here are sold by class: DS2 or RS2 for glaze dust, or DS3 or RS3 for more protection (<a href="https://www.mhlw.go.jp/content/11201000/000587014.pdf">the official classes</a>).</gc-rich> Dust masks in Japan pass a national test (国家検定). DS masks are disposable and RS masks take replaceable filters; class 2 filters at least 95.0% of the test particles, class 3 at least 99.9%. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.mhlw.go.jp/">厚生労働省 (MHLW)</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://anzeninfo.mhlw.go.jp/anzen/gmsds/14808-60-7.html">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.jaish.gr.jp/horei/hor1-18/hor1-18-2-1-2.html">jaish.gr.jp</a>, <a href="https://www.sanei.or.jp/english/files/topics/oels/oel_en_2025.pdf">sanei.or.jp</a>, <a href="https://www.mhlw.go.jp/content/11201000/000587014.pdf">mhlw.go.jp</a>, <a href="https://www.mhlw.go.jp/">mhlw.go.jp</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "LT": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Lithuania"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Lithuania, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://e-seimas.lrs.lt/portal/legalAct/lt/TAD/TAIS.405920/asr">Lietuvos higienos norma HN 23:2011</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://e-seimas.lrs.lt/portal/legalAct/lt/TAD/TAIS.405920/asr">e-seimas.lrs.lt</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "LU": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Luxembourg"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Luxembourg, an 8-hour average (checked October 8, 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0.1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://data.legilux.public.lu/filestore/eli/etat/leg/rgd/2025/03/13/a93/consolide/20260724/fr/pdf/eli-etat-leg-rgd-2025-03-13-a93-consolide-20260724-fr-pdf.pdf">Règlement grand-ducal du 13 mars 2025, annexe III</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://itm.public.lu/fr.html">Inspection du travail et des mines (ITM)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://data.legilux.public.lu/filestore/eli/etat/leg/rgd/2025/03/13/a93/consolide/20260724/fr/pdf/eli-etat-leg-rgd-2025-03-13-a93-consolide-20260724-fr-pdf.pdf">data.legilux.public.lu</a>, <a href="https://itm.public.lu/fr.html">itm.public.lu</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "LV": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Latvia"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Latvia, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://likumi.lv/ta/id/181871-darba-aizsardzibas-prasibas-saskaroties-ar-kancerogenam-vielam-darba-vietas">Ministru kabineta noteikumi Nr. 803, 1. pielikums</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit.  Latvia's law gives this limit for the inhalable fraction of the dust. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.vdi.gov.lv/lv">Valsts darba inspekcija (VDI)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://likumi.lv/ta/id/181871-darba-aizsardzibas-prasibas-saskaroties-ar-kancerogenam-vielam-darba-vietas">likumi.lv</a>, <a href="https://www.vdi.gov.lv/lv">vdi.gov.lv</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "MT": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Malta"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Malta, an 8-hour average (checked 08 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0.1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://legislation.mt/eli/sl/646.14/eng/pdf">S.L. 646.14, Schedule III</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.ohsa.mt/">Awtorità għas-Saħħa u s-Sigurtà fuq il-Post tax-Xogħol (OHSA)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://legislation.mt/eli/sl/646.14/eng/pdf">legislation.mt</a>, <a href="https://www.ohsa.mt/">ohsa.mt</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "NL": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Netherlands"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Netherlands, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,075 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://wetten.overheid.nl/BWBR0008587/2026-08-27">Arbeidsomstandighedenregeling, bijlage XIII</a>.</gc-rich> Lower than the EU's binding limit of 0,1 mg/m³. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.nlarbeidsinspectie.nl/">Nederlandse Arbeidsinspectie</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://wetten.overheid.nl/BWBR0008587/2026-08-27">wetten.overheid.nl</a>, <a href="https://www.nlarbeidsinspectie.nl/">nlarbeidsinspectie.nl</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "NZ": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in New Zealand"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in New Zealand, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0.025 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> An indicative limit: a guide value, not a legal ceiling. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.worksafe.govt.nz/dmsdocument/62251-workplace-exposure-standards-wes-and-biological-exposure-indices-bei-16th-edition/latest/">WorkSafe, Workplace exposure standards, 16th edition</a>.</gc-rich></p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.worksafe.govt.nz/">WorkSafe New Zealand</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://www.worksafe.govt.nz/topic-and-industry/dust/silica-dust-in-the-workplace/">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.worksafe.govt.nz/dmsdocument/62251-workplace-exposure-standards-wes-and-biological-exposure-indices-bei-16th-edition/latest/">worksafe.govt.nz</a>, <a href="https://www.worksafe.govt.nz/">worksafe.govt.nz</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "PL": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Poland"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Poland, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2026/447/text.pdf">Rozporządzenie w sprawie najwyższych dopuszczalnych stężeń i natężeń czynników szkodliwych dla zdrowia (NDS)</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.ciop.pl/">Centralny Instytut Ochrony Pracy – Państwowy Instytut Badawczy (CIOP-PIB)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2026/447/text.pdf">api.sejm.gov.pl</a>, <a href="https://www.ciop.pl/">ciop.pl</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "PT": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Portugal"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Portugal, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2024/12/23500/0010600119.pdf">Decreto-Lei n.º 301/2000, anexo I</a>.</gc-rich> Lower than the EU's binding limit of 0,1 mg/m³. </p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2024/12/23500/0010600119.pdf">files.diariodarepublica.pt</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "RO": "<p>We could not confirm the national limit in Romania. The EU's binding limit of 0,1 mg/m³ applies in every member state.</p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.inspectiamuncii.ro/">Inspecția Muncii</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.inspectiamuncii.ro/">inspectiamuncii.ro</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "SE": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Sweden"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Sweden, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.av.se/arbetsmiljoarbete-och-inspektioner/publikationer/foreskrifter/afs-202314/">Arbetsmiljöverkets föreskrifter AFS 2023:14, bilaga 1</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.av.se/">Arbetsmiljöverket</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://www.av.se/halsa-och-sakerhet/kemiska-risker/risker-for-vissa-amnen-produkter-och-verksamheter/kvartsdamm/">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.av.se/arbetsmiljoarbete-och-inspektioner/publikationer/foreskrifter/afs-202314/">av.se</a>, <a href="https://www.av.se/">av.se</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "SI": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Slovenia"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Slovenia, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,05 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.uradni-list.si/_pdf/2025/Ur/u2025026.pdf">Pravilnik o varovanju delavcev pred tveganji zaradi izpostavljenosti rakotvornim, mutagenim ali reprotoksičnim snovem pri delu, Priloga III</a>.</gc-rich> Lower than the EU's binding limit of 0,1 mg/m³. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.gov.si/drzavni-organi/organi-v-sestavi/inspektorat-za-delo/">Inšpektorat Republike Slovenije za delo (IRSD)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.uradni-list.si/_pdf/2025/Ur/u2025026.pdf">uradni-list.si</a>, <a href="https://www.gov.si/drzavni-organi/organi-v-sestavi/inspektorat-za-delo/">gov.si</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "SK": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in Slovakia"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in Slovakia, an 8-hour average (checked 8 October 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0,1 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://static.slov-lex.sk/pdf/prilohy/SK/ZZ/2006/355/20260715_5862227-2.pdf">Nariadenie vlády č. 355/2006 Z. z., príloha č. 1</a>.</gc-rich> The same as the EU's binding limit. </p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.ip.gov.sk/">Národný inšpektorát práce (NIP)</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://static.slov-lex.sk/pdf/prilohy/SK/ZZ/2006/355/20260715_5862227-2.pdf">static.slov-lex.sk</a>, <a href="https://www.ip.gov.sk/">ip.gov.sk</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
  "US": "<div tabindex="0" role="region" class="guide-table-scroll" aria-label="The silica limit in United States"><table class="guide-table"><caption> The workplace limit for respirable crystalline silica in United States, an 8-hour average (checked October 8, 2026) </caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quartz and cristobalite</th><td class="num">0.05 mg/m³</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Action level</th><td class="num">0.025 mg/m³</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> A binding limit. <gc-rich>Set by <a href="https://www.osha.gov/laws-regs/regulations/standardnumber/1910/1910.1053">29 CFR 1910.1053</a>.</gc-rich></p><p><gc-rich>The national body for safety at work: <a href="https://www.osha.gov/">Occupational Safety and Health Administration (OSHA)</a>.</gc-rich>  <gc-rich>Its <a href="https://www.osha.gov/silica-crystalline">page on silica</a>.</gc-rich></p><gc-source-links><p class="region-sources"> Checked on: <a href="https://www.osha.gov/laws-regs/regulations/standardnumber/1910/1910.1053">osha.gov</a>, <a href="https://www.osha.gov/">osha.gov</a>.</p></gc-source-links>",
}
`;
